      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In truth, a pilgrim came asking\r\nfor permission to gather materials\r\nnear the <SPOT 914> area.",
        "Jp" : "実はね、旅の人が\r\n《<SPOT 914>》の辺りで\r\n採取をしたいって\r\n許可を求めにきたことがあるの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552599,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twas quite a while ago,\r\nso the elder who granted permission\r\nmight have forgotten about it...",
        "Jp" : "だいぶ前のことだったから\r\n入るのを許可した族長も\r\nそのことを忘れているのかも――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552600,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But... if the pilgrim had not come only that day,\r\nbut had come to the area around\r\nthe <SPOT 914> many times—",
        "Jp" : "でも、もしも旅の人があの日だけじゃなく\r\n何度も《<SPOT 914>》の辺りに\r\n来ていたら――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552601,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Arisen, if that pilgrim is in trouble at the\r\n<SPOT 914>, I hope you’ll help them.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さま、もしも《<SPOT 914>》で\r\n旅の人が困っていたら\r\n助けてあげてほしいの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552602,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If there isn't any traveler,\r\nthat would be fine—\r\nbut when you get back from your quest,\r\nplease tell me how it went.",
        "Jp" : "旅の人が居なかったなら\r\nそれでいいんだけど――\r\n討伐から戻ってきたら\r\nどうだったか、お話を聞かせてね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552603,
      "MsgType" : 0,
