      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Come to think of it, I met a youngling called\r\n<NPC 2708>. Seems they want out of the village too.\r\nFelt aught of my younger self in them... so I\r\ntold them a little of the Core Tree.",
        "Jp" : "そういえば<NPC 2708>という子に会ったな\r\nあの子も村の外に出たいんだそうだ\r\n昔の私と似たものを感じて、少し\r\n\"芯なる樹\"の話をしてやったことがあった――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542895,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
