      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You'd go to <SPOT 914>...? Nay, in all\r\nverity—I'd thought this time you'd surely refuse.",
        "Jp" : "《<SPOT 914>》に\r\n行ってくれるというのか――\r\nいや、実のところ\r\n今度こそ断られるかと思っていたのだ"
